BAJ&amp;pg=1495,176436&amp;dq=auto-polo+banned&amp;hl=en\">\"Auto polo latest fad\"</a>. <i>Patterson Daily Press</i><span>. Retrieved <span>23 August</span> 2012</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Patterson+Daily+Press&amp;rft.atitle=Auto+polo+latest+fad&amp;rft.date=1902-07-18&amp;rft.au=Staff&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fnews.google.com%2Fnewspapers%3Fid%3DBXdVAAAAIBAJ%26pg%3D1495%2C176436%26dq%3Dauto-polo%2Bbanned%26hl%3Den&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AAuto+polo\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-perry-6\"><span>^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-perry_6-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-perry_6-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-perry_6-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-perry_6-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-perry_6-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a></span> <span><cite id=\"CITEREFPerry1924\">Perry, Ralph (July 3, 1924). <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=C24uAAAAIBAJ&amp;pg=4165,1117187&amp;dq=auto-polo&amp;hl=en\">\"Miami's new sport will provide thrills for fans\"</a>. <i>The Miami News</i><span>. Retrieved <span>23 August</span> 2012</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Miami+News&amp;rft.atitle=Miami%27s+new+sport+will+provide+thrills+for+fans&amp;rft.date=1924-07-03&amp;rft.aulast=Perry&amp;rft.aufirst=Ralph&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fnews.google.com%2Fnewspapers%3Fid%3DC24uAAAAIBAJ%26pg%3D4165%2C1117187%26dq%3Dauto-polo%26hl%3Den&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AAuto+polo\"></span><sup><span>[<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Link_rot\" title=\"Wikipedia:Link rot\"><span title=\"&nbsp;Dead link tagged September 2023\">permanent dead link</span></a></i>]</span></sup></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-